flowchart LR
    A[Work item] --> B[Discussion + history]
    A --> C[Related items, depth 1-2]
    A --> D[Linked PRs / commits]
    D --> E[Changed files]
    A --> F[Code search on key terms]
    A --> G[Wiki search]
    B & C & E & F & G --> H[LLM in client applies template]
    H --> I[Analysis / impact / plan / doc]
    I -->|optional| J[propose_comment]
